{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[OFFICIAL STATEMENT \u2013 SAFE ZONE CORP.]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Initial Simulation Environment of SAFE ZONE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>DEMO</strong> version contains playable content from the ongoing experiment. You will gain access to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 levels from Chapter 0 \u2013 Introduction</strong>, where you will be trained in observation, death, and adaptation mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 level from Chapter 2 \u2013 The Illusion Protocol</strong>, an advanced preview featuring more complex mechanics and narrative twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initial interactions with <strong>MARA</strong>, our supervisory artificial intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early fragments of the symbolic narrative developed by <strong>SAFE ZONE CORP.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full access to the <strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> for the available levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> between <strong>15 minutes and 2 hours</strong>, depending on your adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <i>Note:</i> This demo does not represent the final version of the experiment. Progress will not carry over to the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your cooperation. Remember: here, <strong>death is not failure. It\u2019s progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 SAFE ZONE CORP.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703220?t=1746669640","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703220?t=1746669640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703220/53eb46db4c72ea87c95f3a1c8497339019c77752/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746669640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703220/53eb46db4c72ea87c95f3a1c8497339019c77752/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746669640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game explores psychological themes such as anxiety, depression, and the desire to give up, including metaphorical references to death and despair. However, it does not contain graphic violence, sexual content, or real-world depictions of self-harm. The content is presented in a symbolic and abstract way, through minimalist visuals and short narrative texts."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[OFFICIAL STATEMENT \u2013 SAFE ZONE CORP.]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Initial Simulation Environment of SAFE ZONE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>DEMO</strong> version contains playable content from the ongoing experiment. You will gain access to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 levels from Chapter 0 \u2013 Introduction</strong>, where you will be trained in observation, death, and adaptation mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 level from Chapter 2 \u2013 The Illusion Protocol</strong>, an advanced preview featuring more complex mechanics and narrative twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initial interactions with <strong>MARA</strong>, our supervisory artificial intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early fragments of the symbolic narrative developed by <strong>SAFE ZONE CORP.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full access to the <strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> for the available levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> between <strong>15 minutes and 2 hours</strong>, depending on your adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <i>Note:</i> This demo does not represent the final version of the experiment. Progress will not carry over to the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your cooperation. Remember: here, <strong>death is not failure. It\u2019s progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 SAFE ZONE CORP.</p>","developers":["Jibakurei Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3699100","name":"SAFE ZONE"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703220/e010f3f18d10a58fb22deb4aad54a33f5f07f49c/header.jpg?t=1746669640","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131498,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131498/movie480.mp4?t=1746472141","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131498/movie_max.mp4?t=1746472141"},"name":"SAFE ZONE demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131498/af0b1d1b9cbc56d24e8168b2687d6c2850d00e7b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746472141","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131498/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746472141","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131498/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746472141"}}],"name":"SAFE ZONE Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Jibakurei Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nMedo","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0